    "A flag older than this shows as unknown, and the home screen asks whether it is still there.": {
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Een ouder vlaggetje wordt onbekend, en het thuisscherm vraagt of het er nog is."
          }
        },
        "sk": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Staršia značka sa zobrazí ako neznáma a obrazovka domova sa spýta, či tam ešte je."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A list only you see. Tap + and choose Just me.": {
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Een lijst die alleen jij ziet. Tik op + en kies Alleen ik."
